# INVWINEG.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: every row of the
# split view's contents chosen, Box B2 holding 258 of the 260 items of
# INVWIN_WINSEEDEG.  CTRL-/ in the contents chooses all 258.  The tree
# moved to Shelf A1 loads the contents again, which ends the choice;
# back on Box B2 one row is chosen.  With all chosen again, a press held
# on a row keeps them, and its drag onto Office moves all 258 there, the
# note counting them and Box B2's contents empty.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEG.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B DOWN DOWN
S LOCS
K F6 CTRL-SLASH
S CALL
K F6 UP
S CMOVED
K DOWN F6
S CONE
K CTRL-SLASH
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
S CHELD
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 0
S COVER
M 208.1 UP ROW 0
S CDROPPED
K ALT-F X
